# HBM-Modernized shared weapon material (anvil convention).
# Weapon OBJs are single-texture models: the real PNG (e.g. uzi.png) is bound
# at draw time by GunGL, and the Nucleus VBO baker un-maps atlas UVs back to
# [0..1]. This library exists because Forge's ObjModel silently drops every
# mesh that has no usemtl-assigned material (ModelMesh.addQuads skips
# mat == null), which made all material-less Blender exports invisible.
# Reference from any asset directory via: "mtllib hbm_m:models/gun.mtl".
newmtl gun
Kd 1.000 1.000 1.000
map_Kd #default
